SECTION 1: PERMITTED INDIVIDUAL & ACCESSIBILITY USE
================================================================================
Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any individual person obtaining
a copy of this software and associated documentation files (the "Software"), to
inspect, run, test, and use the Software on personal audio hardware solely for:
  (a) Non-commercial personal creative music production;
  (b) Assistive accessibility evaluation and personal use by blind or visually
      impaired audio engineers; and
  (c) Non-commercial academic research in accessible audio interfaces.

